===== skills/alpha/SKILL.md =====
---
name: alpha
description: "Alpha workflow for the golden test: plan, build and verify one change. Run only when the user explicitly asks for alpha."
when_to_use: "The user says \"alpha ile yap\" or invokes alpha by name."
argument-hint: "<task>"
disable-model-invocation: true
---

# Alpha

Track the phases with `TodoWrite` (or `TaskCreate`/`TaskUpdate`, whichever this session has, if any). Ask with `AskUserQuestion`: 2 to 4 options.
Launch `buracle:reviewer` with the `Agent` tool, then continue in `/buracle:beta`.
Inline code keeps one span: `/alpha <task>` and `AskUserQuestion`.
A literal placeholder stays literal: {{ask_user}} and {{skill:alpha}}.
Unknown placeholders are left alone: {{nope}} and {{skill:Bad Id}}.

```text
buracle:reviewer
plan_file: docs/plans/x.md
```

Claude block line.
Inline claude marker.

See [references/ref.md](references/ref.md).
